WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:05.398
Let's see what's happening with Polly and Jack.

2
00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:19.874
Are they still in the forest?

3
00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:25.080
Jack: Look! The birds are following us!

4
00:00:25.081 --> 00:00:29.436
Polly: They're eating all the cracker

5
00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:47.823
crumbs! Jack: Uh-oh. How will we get out of the

6
00:00:47.824 --> 00:00:52.910
forest? Polly: There's a

7
00:00:52.911 --> 00:01:05.208
house. Maybe someone can help us.

8
00:01:05.209 --> 00:01:08.290
Jack: The house is made of candies.

9
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:17.633
Polly: And cookies. Yum!

10
00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:21.318
Jack: Polly! Don't eat the house!

11
00:01:21.319 --> 00:01:42.433
Polly: Try some, Jack.

12
00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:46.677
Witch: Who's out there?

13
00:01:46.678 --> 00:01:50.072
Are you eating my house? Jack:

14
00:01:50.073 --> 00:01:53.952
Sorry. We're lost.

15
00:01:53.953 --> 00:02:04.249
Polly: And hungry!

16
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:11.060
Witch: Come inside. I'll take care of you.

17
00:02:11.061 --> 00:02:20.220
Jack: Thank you.

18
00:02:20.221 --> 00:02:25.147
Witch: Have some soup.

19
00:02:25.148 --> 00:02:40.581
Jack: Mmm. This soup is good.

20
00:02:40.582 --> 00:02:44.058
Witch: I can't see or hear well.

21
00:02:44.059 --> 00:02:49.181
But I'm a very good cook—and witch! Jack:

22
00:02:49.182 --> 00:02:53.114
Huh? Polly:

23
00:02:53.115 --> 00:03:11.439
I'm sooo sleepy. Jack:

24
00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:29.254
Polly! Wake up, Polly! Polly:

25
00:03:29.255 --> 00:03:32.892
Jack, why are you in that cage?

26
00:03:32.893 --> 00:03:37.142
Jack: The witch put me in here!

27
00:03:37.143 --> 00:03:42.898
Uh-oh. The witch locked Jack in a cage.

28
00:03:42.899 --> 00:03:46.969
Will she lock up Polly too?

